@startuml rnn_v2_class_diagram
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title rnn_v2 Class Diagram — Skip-Connection Models + Registry

package "ai.rnn_v2" #LightYellow {
    class GRUPolicyModelV2 <<nn.Module>> {
        + INITIAL_HIDDEN_STATE: list[float]
        - gru: nn.GRU(42, 32, num_layers=1)
        - fc1: nn.Linear(74, 64)
        - fc2: nn.Linear(64, 32)
        - fc_policy: nn.Linear(32, 14)
        --
        + forward(x, hidden, mask_fn, temperature): tuple
    }

    class GRUValueModelV2 <<nn.Module>> {
        + INITIAL_HIDDEN_STATE: list[float]
        - gru: nn.GRU(42, 32, num_layers=1)
        - fc1: nn.Linear(74, 64)
        - fc2: nn.Linear(64, 32)
        - fc_value: nn.Linear(32, 1)
        --
        + forward(x, hidden): tuple
    }
}

package "ai" {
    class TrainingRunner {
        + run(config): None
        - _build_models(model_name): tuple
        - _train_value_epoch(...): dict
        - _train_policy_epoch(...): dict
        - _recompute_advantages(...): None
    }

    class Registry <<module>> {
        + _REGISTRY: list[dict]
        + get_ai_info(ai_name): dict
        + list_ais(): list[dict]
        + parse_ai_name(ai_name): tuple
    }
}

package "app" {
    class AppManager {
        - _load_model(module, class, weight_path): nn.Module
        + ai_sample_action(state, ai_name): dict
    }

    class Converter {
        + build_input_vector(state, player_key): list[float]
        + action_to_policy_index(card, build_target): int
        + policy_index_to_action(index): tuple
    }
}

TrainingRunner --> GRUPolicyModelV2 : creates/trains
TrainingRunner --> GRUValueModelV2 : creates/trains
TrainingRunner ..> Registry : get_ai_info
AppManager --> GRUPolicyModelV2 : loads
AppManager --> GRUValueModelV2 : loads
AppManager ..> Registry : get_ai_info
AppManager ..> Converter : build_input_vector

note right of Registry
    rnn_v2 entry:
    module: src.backend.ai.rnn_v2.model
    policy class: GRUPolicyModelV2
    value class: GRUValueModelV2
end note

note bottom of Converter
    Unchanged — INPUT_SIZE=42
    POLICY_OUTPUT_SIZE=14
    v1/v2 共享同一个 Converter
end note

@enduml
